{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02713","headline":"七夕 · 张文恭","name":"七夕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤律惊秋气，龙梭静夜机。\n星桥百枝动，云路七香飞。\n映月回雕扇，凌霞曳绮衣。\n含情向华幄，流态入重闱。\n欢余夕漏尽，怨结晓骖归。\n谁念分河汉，还忆两心违。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张文恭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02713.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02713","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}